            "id": 145333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Что выводит этот код в консоль?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145334,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Проверь, является ли <code>playerHealth</code> меньше или равно <code>20</code> с помощью оператора \"меньше или равно\", <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lowHealth = playerHealth &lt;= \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low health: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + lowHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145335,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Сохрани результат <code>score &gt;= 10</code> в переменной <code>unlockedLevelTwo</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" unlockedLevelTwo = score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 2 unlocked: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + unlockedLevelTwo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>=</code>, а затем <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
